                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is a monthly skincare marketing retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Recurring monthly investment in growth engine. Rs 65K Starter / Rs 1.8L Growth / Rs 4.5L+ Enterprise. Excludes ad spend (transparent pass-through). Weekly + monthly + quarterly cadence with team + reporting.</p>
                                        <h3>What is weekly cadence in skincare marketing retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Monday kickoff + Tuesday-Thursday execution + Friday performance snapshot + Slack brief. Weekly rhythm keeps velocity + prevents week-of-month lag. Slack response within 4-8 hours business days.</p>
                                        <h3>What is included in monthly QBR?</h3>
                                        <p>Revenue + LTV/CAC/cohort recap + channel-by-channel performance + CPL + ROAS + attribution + creative + content highlights + fatigue check + next-month plan + risks + blockers. 90-120 min. Founder + senior + CMO attendance.</p>
                                        <h3>What team do we get at each tier?</h3>
                                        <p>Starter: 2-person pod (strategist + execution). Growth: 4-6-person pod (strategist + paid + SEO + content + designer + WhatsApp). Enterprise: 5-10-person pod (strategist + paid multi-channel + SEO + content team + creative pod + WhatsApp + creator + PR + regional). Named individuals + org chart shared.</p>
                                        <h3>How is reporting delivered?</h3>
                                        <p>Weekly Friday snapshot + bi-weekly creative + content review + monthly QBR + written report + LTV/CAC/cohort + next-month plan + quarterly QBR in-person + cohort deep-dive + strategic + budget + board-prep + annual year-in-review + next-year strategy.</p>
                                        <h3>Is ad spend bundled in retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>No. Transparent pass-through. Client pays platforms direct OR ITD bills exactly what spent + platform receipts. Rs 40K-40L+/month depending on tier. No 15-30% markup that generic agencies bundle.</p>
                                        <h3>What ancillary costs come outside retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Ad spend (pass-through). Third-party tooling (Klaviyo + Interakt + apps). Creator + PR fees (pass-through). Shopify + app subscriptions (client-billed direct). Legal + trademark + compliance (pass-through). Full transparency with single monthly invoice + receipts.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD structure skincare marketing retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Weekly cadence + monthly QBR + quarterly in-person QBR + named team pod (2-10 people by tier) + investor-grade reporting + ad spend transparent + tooling pass-through. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a> for tier detail.</p>
